/S /P
/E (The Seed Accelerator Meet 2025, convened by the IRRI South Asia Hub, served as a dynamic platform to deepen strategic collaborations and drive innovation across rice breeding and seed systems in India. Against the backdrop of growing climate variability and shifting market preferences, the workshop brought together a diverse coalition of stakeholders committed to transforming the rice seed landscape through accelerated varietal turnover and inclusive seed delivery models.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
