/T (In conclusion, Dr. Dey emphasized the urgency of accelerating varietal turnover and modernizing seed system strategies. He noted that while progress has been made, a more integrated and rapid approach is essential to fully realize the potential of agricultural innovations and ensure equitable benefits for farmers across diverse ecosystems.)
/E (In conclusion, Dr. Dey emphasized the urgency of accelerating varietal turnover and modernizing seed system strategies. He noted that while progress has been made, a more integrated and rapid approach is essential to fully realize the potential of agricultural innovations and ensure equitable benefits for farmers across diverse ecosystems.)
