/E (He introduced HarvestPlus Solutions, a for-profit arm of the program that facilitates technology and germplasm exchange between CGIAR institutions, NARES, and the private sector. With operations in five countries, the entity plays a vital role in strengthening agricultural technology transfer and fostering collaborative development of nutrient-rich crops.)
