500 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Dr. Govindaraj stressed the importance of leveraging staple foods, widely consumed across rural and vulnerable populations, as vehicles for delivering essential micronutrients. He reiterated the urgency of mobilizing resources to reach the HarvestPlus goal of improving the nutrition of one billion people by 2030. He also shared that HarvestPlus focuses on three key micronutrients - iron, zinc, and vitamin A, endorsed by the World Health Organization and considered essential due to their role in addressing anaemia, stunting, and blindness, respectively. These deficiencies are especially prevalent in low- and middle-income countries, including India.)
/E (Dr. Govindaraj stressed the importance of leveraging staple foods, widely consumed across rural and vulnerable populations, as vehicles for delivering essential micronutrients. He reiterated the urgency of mobilizing resources to reach the HarvestPlus goal of improving the nutrition of one billion people by 2030. He also shared that HarvestPlus focuses on three key micronutrients - iron, zinc, and vitamin A, endorsed by the World Health Organization and considered essential due to their role in addressing anaemia, stunting, and blindness, respectively. These deficiencies are especially prevalent in low- and middle-income countries, including India.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
