/T (Structured Procurement and Market Incentives in Uttar Pradesh Mr. Anuj Kumar Singh from the Uttar Pradesh Beej Vikas Nigam \(UBVN\) noted that seed production in UP is aligned with projected demands. UBVN produces around 20% of the seeds, while state seed farms account for the remaining 80%. Breeder seed procurement is often carried out through collaborations with IRRI. However, a noticeable shift in farmer preference towards hybrid rice has resulted in declining state-led rice seed production.)
/E (Structured Procurement and Market Incentives in Uttar Pradesh Mr. Anuj Kumar Singh from the Uttar Pradesh Beej Vikas Nigam \(UBVN\) noted that seed production in UP is aligned with projected demands. UBVN produces around 20% of the seeds, while state seed farms account for the remaining 80%. Breeder seed procurement is often carried out through collaborations with IRRI. However, a noticeable shift in farmer preference towards hybrid rice has resulted in declining state-led rice seed production.)
