/T ( Policy and Market Disincentives in Odisha Mr. Aditya Kumar Panda of the Odisha State Seed Corporation \(OSSC\) pointed out the challenges arising from policy-driven varietal introductions. He noted that multiple varieties are being promoted in Odisha. Many of these varieties fail to proceed beyond the foundation seed stage due to concerns over maintaining quality during large-scale multiplication.)
