/T (Strengths and Technical Challenges in Maharashtra Dr. Prafull Lahane of Mahabeej \(Maharashtra State Seeds Corporation\) reported a rising demand for early maturing rice varieties \(110-day duration\) with short, slender grains. However, the availability of such seeds remains limited. Given that IRRI is unable to directly supply breeder seeds to interested institutions, Mahabeej is open to facilitating such transfers through Memoranda of Understanding \(MoUs\). Based on OFT results, Mahabeej also expressed interest in procuring breeder seeds or germplasm for certified seed production.)
/E (Strengths and Technical Challenges in Maharashtra Dr. Prafull Lahane of Mahabeej \(Maharashtra State Seeds Corporation\) reported a rising demand for early maturing rice varieties \(110-day duration\) with short, slender grains. However, the availability of such seeds remains limited. Given that IRRI is unable to directly supply breeder seeds to interested institutions, Mahabeej is open to facilitating such transfers through Memoranda of Understanding \(MoUs\). Based on OFT results, Mahabeej also expressed interest in procuring breeder seeds or germplasm for certified seed production.)
/Pg 29 0 R
