/T (Mahabeej possesses 23 seed processing units and advanced facilities, including seed testing laboratories equipped with DNA fingerprinting capabilities. The agency has requested capacity-building support in the areas of DNA fingerprinting and seed health testing. Nonetheless, major challenges persist with respect to insect-pest infestations during storage and inadequate fumigation practices. Dr. Lahane suggested that these challenges may be common across other SSCs and proposed a joint discussion to explore possible solutions.)
