/S /H2
/T (Leveraging Surplus Seed Production To address seed shortages, Dr. Mishra proposed that seed growers associated with SSCs corporations could produce surplus seeds beyond the indented quantities and supply them to private companies. This approach could enhance seed availability and foster public-private partnerships in seed distribution.)
/E (Leveraging Surplus Seed Production To address seed shortages, Dr. Mishra proposed that seed growers associated with SSCs corporations could produce surplus seeds beyond the indented quantities and supply them to private companies. This approach could enhance seed availability and foster public-private partnerships in seed distribution.)
/Pg 31 0 R
