/E (A key takeaway was the urgent need to bridge gaps between innovation and impact by streamlining the flow of information, seeds, and feedback between breeders and farmers. Participants discussed the importance of demand forecasting, tailored varietal promotion strategies, and decentralized seed production models that empower local actors. The conversations reflected a maturing seed ecosystem, one increasingly driven by inclusivity, resilience, and evidence-backed decisions.)
